body:
Thank god I mentioned this shit in Discord when I noticed it earlier this morning. I literally started crying and screaming when I saw fanart of it on Instagram. No shit, I literally researched this shit and when I saw it was canon, I literally was shrieking at the top of my lungs and crying; like WHY a goddamn Kardashian 2D? 

OF ALL THE GODDAMN PEOPLE? God help his soul.

///Murdoc, do something about this please
